rooms_desc ({"This is the center room of Joe and Tatiana's house. Candles are everywhere,providing a nice warm glow and gentle warmth.  This room has everything theyneed to relax.  As you look about you see an entertainment center, a largewaterbed, and thousands of compact discs.","This room is filled with lots of interresting toys, all designed to shape and tone Joe and Tatiana's figures.  Among the things in this room are:hand weights, a large heavy bag, a running machine anand a strange looking machine.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
